repository-code: "https://github.com/mehta-lab/VisCy"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  DynaCell is an evaluation framework for 3D time-lapse virtual staining of
  live cells. It combines paired 3D time-lapse images acquired with and without
  fluorescent labels, a suite of baseline models, and three metric tiers that
  measure pixel-level fidelity, organelle segmentation performance, and
  single-cell phenotype similarity.
keywords:
  - virtual staining
  - live-cell imaging
  - benchmarking
  - microscopy
  - deep learning
